  sequenceDiagram
      actor Clinician
      participant BahmniWeb as Bahmni Web
      participant OpenMRS
      participant AF_OMRS as Atomfeed (OpenMRS DB)
      participant OpenELIS
      actor LabTech as Lab Technician

      Clinician->>BahmniWeb: Create lab order
      BahmniWeb->>OpenMRS: POST /ws/rest/v1/order
      OpenMRS->>AF_OMRS: Publish lab order event

      OpenELIS->>AF_OMRS: Poll for new events
      AF_OMRS-->>OpenELIS: Lab order event
      OpenELIS->>OpenELIS: Add order to lab queue

      LabTech->>OpenELIS: View & process sample
      LabTech->>OpenELIS: Enter results
      OpenELIS->>OpenELIS: Publish result to its own Atomfeed

      OpenMRS->>OpenELIS: Poll OpenELIS Atomfeed
      OpenELIS-->>OpenMRS: Lab result event
      OpenMRS->>OpenMRS: Store observation/result

      Clinician->>BahmniWeb: View results
      BahmniWeb->>OpenMRS: GET /ws/rest/v1/obs
      OpenMRS-->>Clinician: Lab results displayed